## App Router Structure
```
src/
  app/
    (auth)/
      login/
        page.tsx
    (dashboard)/
      layout.tsx              ← sidebar layout wrapper
      dashboard/
        page.tsx
      specifications/
        page.tsx
        [id]/
          page.tsx
        create/
          page.tsx
      templates/
        page.tsx
        create/
          page.tsx
        [id]/
          edit/
            page.tsx
    providers.tsx             ← QueryClientProvider + HeroUIProvider wrapper
  components/
    layout/
      sidebar.tsx
      topbar.tsx
    ui/                       ← shared reusable components
    specs/                    ← spec-specific components
    templates/                ← template-specific components
  mocks/
    auth.mock.ts
    spec.mock.ts
    template.mock.ts
  services/                   ← empty shells, TODO comments only
    auth.service.ts
    spec.service.ts
    template.service.ts
  types/
    api.types.ts
  lib/
    axios.ts                  ← global axios instance
    query-client.ts           ← QueryClient config
    mock-utils.ts
    utils.ts
```

