## Routing
- `/` → redirect to `/dashboard`
- Auth: hardcoded redirect for demo, no real session check
- Add next-auth after demo — do not wire it now
- All protected pages live under `(dashboard)` route group
- Do NOT use middleware.ts — use proxy.ts if request interception is needed

---

## Dark Mode
- Supported via HeroUI + Tailwind CSS v4
- Toggle lives in sidebar bottom section
- Use HeroUI's `useTheme` hook to toggle between light/dark
- Persist preference in localStorage key: `theme`
- Default: system preference via `prefers-color-scheme`
- Apply `dark` class on `<html>` element
- All components must support both light and dark — use Tailwind dark: variants
- Never hardcode light-only colors — always pair with dark: equivalent

### Dark Mode Color Mapping
```
Light                          Dark
zinc-50  (content bg)     →   zinc-950
white    (card bg)         →   zinc-900
zinc-200 (border)          →   zinc-700
zinc-900 (sidebar)         →   zinc-950  (slightly darker)
zinc-800 (sidebar active)  →   zinc-800  (same)
```

---

## Design System

### Overall Feel
- Working tool aesthetic — think Linear, Vercel dashboard, not a SaaS marketing page
- Compact density — tighter spacing, less padding than typical marketing designs
- Strong typographic hierarchy
- Functional over decorative — reduce icons and decorative elements
- Supports light and dark mode

### Layout
- Sidebar: fixed left, 240px wide, dark (`zinc-900` light / `zinc-950` dark)
- Content area: fills remaining width, `zinc-50` light / `zinc-950` dark
- Topbar: inside content area, white/zinc-900 bg, border-bottom, 64px tall
- Page content: padded container, 24px padding

### Sidebar Structure
```
Top:
  [SpecBuilder logo + icon]

Navigation:
  - Dashboard         (LayoutDashboard icon)
  - Specifications    (FileText icon)
  - Templates         (Layout icon)

Bottom:
  - Theme toggle      (Sun/Moon icon)
  - User avatar + name
  - Logout button
```

Sidebar item states:
- Inactive: zinc-400 text, transparent bg
- Active:   white text, zinc-800 bg, rounded-md
- Hover:    zinc-700 bg

### Color Palette
- Sidebar bg:        zinc-900 / dark:zinc-950
- Sidebar text:      zinc-400 (inactive), white (active)
- Sidebar active:    zinc-800
- Content bg:        zinc-50 / dark:zinc-950
- Card bg:           white / dark:zinc-900
- Border:            zinc-200 / dark:zinc-700
- Primary:           blue-600
- Danger:            red-500
- Success:           green-600
- Warning:           amber-500
- Processing:        blue-500

### Status Badge Colors
- PENDING     → gray badge + Clock icon
- PROCESSING  → blue badge + animated Loader2 spinner icon
- COMPLETED   → green badge
- REVIEWED    → green badge + CheckCircle icon
- FAILED      → red badge + AlertCircle icon

NOTE: There is NO EXPORTED status — export is tracked by exportedOn timestamp only.
A spec can be exported regardless of its current status (COMPLETED or REVIEWED).

### Risk Priority Badge Colors
- HIGH    → red badge
- MEDIUM  → amber badge
- LOW     → green badge

