## Mock Data Scale
- 5-6 mock specs with mixed statuses: PENDING, PROCESSING, COMPLETED, REVIEWED, FAILED
  NOTE: No EXPORTED status in mock data
- 4 mock templates: Standard Template, Mobile App Template, API Template, UI/UX Template
  - Mix of English and Thai — at least 1 Thai template
  - Each with realistic section titles and descriptions
- 1 spec with 3 versions (demo version history tab)
- 1 spec with 3-4 risks (demo ambiguities tab)
  - Each risk must include: priority (HIGH|MEDIUM|LOW), type, related section name, detail, referenceText (MOM quote)
- Realistic names, dates, content — not placeholder text

