- "Save Template" → 300ms mock delay → /templates + success toast

**Validation (inline errors on submit):**
- Template name required
- At least 1 section
- Each section: title + description required

---

## Component Rules
- Server components by default
- `'use client'` only for: forms, interactive state, polling, DnD, theme toggle
- Forms: react-hook-form + zodResolver always
- Never write inline Zod schemas — import from @spec-app/schemas
- Never use `any`
- Use `import type` for type-only imports in decorated contexts
- Do NOT manually add useMemo/useCallback — React Compiler handles this
- Always support both light and dark variants on every component

---

## Loading & Empty States
Every data page must handle:
- Loading: HeroUI Skeleton components
- Empty: icon + message + CTA button
- Error: error message + retry/action button

---

## State Management
- Local useState for all UI state
- No global store needed for demo
- Polling: useEffect + setInterval for demo, React Query refetchInterval after wiring
- Poll for both PENDING and PROCESSING statuses
- Toast: HeroUI addToast
- Theme: localStorage key `theme`, applied as `dark` class on `<html>`

---

## What NOT To Do
- Do not write Zod schemas — always import from @spec-app/schemas
- Do not make real API calls — use mock functions only (until after demo)
- Do not use raw axios — always use the global api instance from src/lib/axios.ts
- Do not add authentication logic — hardcoded redirect for demo
- Do not use pages/ router — App Router only
- Do not use `any` in TypeScript
- Do not use middleware.ts — deprecated in Next.js 16, use proxy.ts
- Do not add --turbopack flag — it runs by default in Next.js 16
- Do not manually add useMemo/useCallback — React Compiler handles memoization
- Do not add "Mark as Resolved" or "Add Note" to risk cards
- Do not add "Restore" button to version history
- Do not use a top navbar — sidebar only
- Do not include Available Templates section on dashboard
- Do not include hero/CTA section on dashboard
- Do not use a 4-step wizard — 2 steps only
- Do not add username field — email only
- Do not generate actual PDF — toast only for demo
- Do not allow language change on template edit mode
- Do not allow deleting the last remaining section of a template
- Do not extract text from uploaded files on frontend — backend handles extraction
- Do not add EXPORTED as a status badge — no such status exists
- Do not disable Export PDF button based on exported status — use COMPLETED/REVIEWED check only
- Do not show spec description as empty string — only show if it exists
- Do not hardcode light-only colors — always pair with dark: variant
- Do not use NEXT_PUBLIC_ env vars for sensitive data — baseURL only
